    "description": "Maxell Sony RCA Blank Audio Cassette Tape Lot\n8 Piece Collection\nNormal Bias Type I Tapes\nThis lot features eight factory-sealed blank audio cassette tapes from Maxell, Sony, and RCA. These Normal Bias Type I tapes are ideal for everyday recording and general music use. As physical media sees a resurgence, these sealed tapes offer a reliable way to capture analog audio on cassette decks and portable recorders.\nItems Included:\n1.\nMaxell UR 120 (6 Tapes)\n- Normal Bias, 120 minutes, IEC Type I.\n2.\nSony HF 60 (1 Tape)\n- High Fidelity Normal Bias, 60 minutes, Type I.\n3.\nRCA Hi-Fi Stereo (1 Tape)\n- Normal Bias, 90 minutes, Type I.\nCondition:\nAll eight tapes are factory sealed in original cellophane. The plastic wrap is intact on all units. The hard plastic cases appear undamaged under the wrap. Some tapes feature original retail or thrift price stickers on the exterior plastic. Magnetic tape functionality is not guaranteed due to the age of the media.",
